Test TCLLIBPATH separator fix
==============================

This test verifies that TCLLIBPATH uses space separators (as required by Tcl)
rather than colon separators (which are used by PATH, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, etc).

The test:
1. Sources the rip-environment script multiple times
2. Verifies that TCLLIBPATH contains space-separated paths
3. Verifies that paths are not duplicated with colons

This ensures that running rip-environment or linuxcnc script multiple times
doesn't break the TCLLIBPATH variable.
